        "raw": "{\n  \"decision\": \"APPROVED\",\n  \"remarks\": \"Site inspected physically. The drain slab has suffered structural fracture and requires replacement with a precast reinforced concrete cover slab.\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"Deploy precast slab crew from PWD Zone 5.\"\n}"
      }
    },
